1
00:01:01,119 --> 00:01:02,119
Ghost!

2
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:03,359
The ghost is back!

3
00:01:03,359 --> 00:01:04,200
Ghost!

4
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,079
Ghost!

5
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:15,879
Cousin.

6
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:17,040
It's me.

7
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,319
Cousin.

8
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:25,319
Don't move. Just lie still.

9
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:28,159
You had quite a scare
at my house yesterday.

10
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:29,840
I came specifically to see you.

11
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,519
I haven't been busy lately.

12
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:32,560
Cousin.

13
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:34,000
You don't have a fever, do you?

14
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:40,239
Your dad only cares about Cousin Tianting.

15
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,200
He's almost forgotten

16
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,840
that in this family,

17
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,599
there is a

18
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:48,040
smart and capable
second young master like you.

19
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:53,879
Even though your mother is the legal wife,

20
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,879
this distinction of birthright

21
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,120
is just too unfair to you.

22
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:58,920
I...

23
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:00,879
I'm a concubine's son.

24
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,640
How...

25
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:04,079
How could I compare to my brother?

26
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:07,760
But I think you're much better
than your brother.

27
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,280
Really.

28
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:14,960
It's just a pity

29
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,080
that the Qi family's estate
will belong to your brother.

30
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:23,120
Even I will belong to your brother.

31
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:39,520
Mother.

32
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:42,000
Mother!

33
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,479
Mother!

34
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:48,039
Mother, listen to this.

35
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:50,159
I've already fooled that idiot Qi Tiankun.

36
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:52,280
In a bit, I'll go cry to cousin Tianting.

37
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,120
I'll tell him

38
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,599
that my cousin has designs on me.

39
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:57,199
As long as I turn the two brothers
against each other,

40
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:58,680
the Qi family will eventually
be in our grasp.

41
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,879
Mother...

42
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,080
Mother?

43
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:05,520
Mother!

44
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,400
Ling Yu...

45
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:13,159
Hurry up and leave.

46
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:16,199
Stay away

47
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:19,080
from the Sheng family.

48
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:25,120
Ling Yu, are you in here?

49
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,319
Ling Yu!

50
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,759
I have something to tell you.

51
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,639
Ling Yu

52
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:27,319
Zhang Tianyou.

53
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,560
For over twenty years in the Sheng family,

54
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,199
every few years,

55
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:36,319
someone dies at night for no reason.

56
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,480
Zhang Tianyou,

57
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,920
what am I supposed to do?

58
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:48,800
Since your parents entrusted you to me,

59
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:51,240
I'll definitely keep you safe.

60
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,560
Zhang Tianyou,

61
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,439
I'll do whatever you say.

62
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,040
Why don't we go down and take a look?

63
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:02,240
Zhang Tianyou, what are you doing?

64
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,480
Mouse,

65
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,720
take her down for a look.

66
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,759
Tianting.

67
00:05:21,319 --> 00:05:23,399
Tonight's operation is called Nest Raid.

68
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:24,959
Dad believes in you.

69
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:26,519
Don't worry, Dad.

70
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,639
Just watch me.

71
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:28,439
Remember!

72
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,319
Kill the live-in son-in-law,
snatch the treasure!

73
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,759
As for tonight,

74
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:35,199
only heaven, earth, you, and Dad will know.

75
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:37,120
No one else can ever find out.

76
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,560
Dad, I don't need to snatch Ling Yu.

77
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:41,439
We're childhood sweethearts.

78
00:05:41,439 --> 00:05:43,439
She listens to whatever I say.

79
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,120
This is basically...

80
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,439
All right, all right, all right!

81
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,800
Son, that Earth Vein
Incantation Scripture,

82
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:48,959
that Scripture is the real treasure, okay?

83
00:05:48,959 --> 00:05:50,759
Then, should Qi Tiankun come along?

84
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,879
How can you be so stupid?

85
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:57,800
Son, you are the genuine article.

86
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:00,800
Tiankun is a freebie at best.

87
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,199
In the future,

88
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:04,000
the entire Qi family will be yours.

89
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,879
All mine.

90
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,279
I understand, Dad.

91
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,600
Kill the live-in son-in-law,
snatch the treasure!

92
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,680
Yeah!

93
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:19,040
Why didn't my dad tell me

94
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,839
there was a place like this?

95
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,519
It's fine, it's fine.

96
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,720
Sir, look.

97
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,720
Why did the fire turn green?

98
00:06:50,639 --> 00:06:51,360
Don't touch it!

99
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,560
This is a Corpse Lamp.

100
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:57,199
It's corpse oil mixed with rare minerals.

101
00:06:57,279 --> 00:06:59,800
It emits a hallucinogenic scent when lit.

102
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:02,319
Don't touch anything in here!

103
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,879
If you touch it, we might end up
just like him...

104
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,959
...stuck here forever to point the way.

105
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,600
Hold this in your mouth.

106
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,040
What just happened to me?

107
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,680
You almost met your maker again.

108
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,959
Tianyou.

109
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:24,120
The path is in the painting.

110
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:30,240
Look.

111
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:31,279
Life.

112
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,720
Death.

113
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,320
Life.

114
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,360
Wait a minute.

115
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,519
The path ghosts take...

116
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:44,519
how could it be the path to life?

117
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:46,480
Then... that's...

118
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,600
Life through death.

119
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,879
The path to life is right here!

120
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,519
Zhang Tianyou!

121
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:14,480
How is there a place like this underground?

122
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:30,960
Looks like the Sheng family's
underground ancestral hall.

123
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:50,200
This incantation scripture

124
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:52,639
records methods to suppress corpses
and ward off evil.

125
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,080
Could it be that

126
00:09:54,399 --> 00:09:55,519
my father's death

127
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:58,159
was due to some unknown cause?

128
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,799
That's right.

129
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,559
I found out that

130
00:10:01,879 --> 00:10:05,480
it wasn't just The Four Great Families
who surveyed the terrain back then,

131
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:09,320
but also the Zhang family
of the Dragon-Seeking Lineage.

132
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,960
The Dragon-Seeking Zhang family?

133
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:13,240
Didn't their bloodline die out long ago?

134
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:16,080
It's precisely because their
Dragon-Seeking Formula was lost long ago

135
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,360
that we went through so much trouble
to find the cave-locating treasure,

136
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,480
the Dragon-Seeking Ruler.

137
00:10:32,279 --> 00:10:33,440
You were right just now.

138
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:39,279
But back then, only
The Four Great Families left the chamber.

139
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:42,799
Patriarch Zhang of the
Dragon-Seeking Lineage and his clan

140
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,720
all inexplicably vanished into thin air.

141
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:49,519
It seems returning to that old chamber

142
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:50,639
to figure everything out

143
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:52,919
will still take some effort.
